sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Sender as Sender Device
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    actor Phone as Recipient Phone
    actor Desktop as Recipient Desktop

    Sender->>API: Submit Envelope for User B
    API->>DB: Query active devices for User B
    DB-->>API: Returns [Device_Phone, Device_Desktop]
    API->>DB: INSERT 2 recipient device records
    API->>Phone: Deliver envelope via WSS
    API->>Desktop: Deliver envelope via WSS
